DCERP Field = Summary of Allocations.
|||||
|||||_Preset [p,-]       ==  p = PT preset, - No Preset.
||||
||||__Reset [g,r,-]      ==  g= Global AR, r = PT reset, - No reset.
|||
|||___Clock Enable [e,-] ==  e = Product Term, - always enabled, - none.
||
